@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8787

### Feed health (JSON)
GET {{baseUrl}}/live/feed/health
Accept: application/json

### Feed status (JSON)
GET {{baseUrl}}/live/feed/status
Accept: application/json

### OHLCV chart (HTML)
GET {{baseUrl}}/live/feed/chart
Accept: text/html

### Legacy health alias (direct service only; not under /live)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Legacy status alias (direct service only; not under /live)
GET {{baseUrl}}/status
Accept: application/json
